WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.613
MoveBooks AI is built on Google Cloud and powered by Gemini AI.

00:00:04.793 --> 00:00:10.067
It guides accounting migration from readiness assessment through
verified first productive use.

00:00:10.247 --> 00:00:16.652
Here, focus on a mapping that needs judgment, and the two
genuine Gemini roles that help a person review it.

00:00:16.832 --> 00:00:20.816
We are examining saved results, not making a new model call.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:29.263
Start with the selected account twelve hundred, Misc Clearing,
and the proposed destination, Other Current

00:00:29.263 --> 00:00:29.623
Asset.

00:00:29.803 --> 00:00:33.028
This saved production screen shows a recorded decision.

00:00:33.208 --> 00:00:38.500
The editorial highlight directs attention to the mapping; it is
not a new selection or approval.

00:00:42.261 --> 00:00:48.056
These genuine production screenshots show previously generated
Gemini results for the account twelve

00:00:48.056 --> 00:00:50.432
hundred, Misc Clearing, ready for review.

00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:54.391
Run AI-Assisted Analysis is visible, but we do not click it.

00:00:54.551 --> 00:00:58.361
We are reviewing a saved response, not generating a new one.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.475
The Advisor explains why this mapping needs judgment.

00:01:04.635 --> 00:01:07.233
The proposed destination is Other Current Asset.

00:01:07.393 --> 00:01:13.840
Its supplied candidate confidence is zero point seven six: a
mapping input, not a guarantee of model

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:14.420
accuracy.

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:17.713
The source purpose and acceptance criteria are missing.

00:01:17.873 --> 00:01:23.830
The recommendation is to escalate to a qualified human, grounded
in the escalation flag and policy

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:24.560
constraints.

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:29.188
The explanation preserves uncertainty instead of inventing an
accounting story.

00:01:31.367 --> 00:01:33.768
The independent Reviewer returns QUESTION.

00:01:33.928 --> 00:01:37.704
It challenges the recommendation against the supplied source
facts.

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:42.570
A compatible account type does not establish a clearing
account's business purpose.

00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:47.861
The Reviewer highlights the missing purpose, confidence
threshold and need for human review.

00:01:48.021 --> 00:01:50.776
Accepting reasoning is never approval of the mapping.

00:01:50.936 --> 00:01:55.095
Neither Advisor nor Reviewer can authorize a migration or post
an invoice.

00:01:55.255 --> 00:01:57.192
The human retains that authority.

00:01:59.367 --> 00:02:03.913
Here, the saved explanation brings the mapping's supporting
evidence into view.

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:06.560
Private details stay hidden.

00:02:06.732 --> 00:02:11.771
Saved results belong to their mapping; switching context clears
outdated analysis.

00:02:11.942 --> 00:02:15.242
Reopening retrieves the existing explanation for review.

00:02:15.583 --> 00:02:16.770
No model is called.

00:02:16.988 --> 00:02:19.749
The reopening itself is not shown in this footage.

00:02:20.304 --> 00:02:25.505
The saved snapshot informs a person; deterministic validation
remains authoritative.

00:02:27.667 --> 00:02:28.633
MoveBooks AI.

00:02:28.813 --> 00:02:29.756
Move your books.

00:02:29.936 --> 00:02:31.203
Keep your confidence.
